name: Evaluate Best
description: Judge candidate options independently against your criteria, then pick one winner — stating
  what the winner sacrifices. Uses an accepted frame as the rubric and challenge reports as evidence.
  Guided by the evaluate-best judgment skill.
tags:
- evaluate-best
prompt: Run the evaluate-best skill over the candidate options in this input. Judge each candidate independently against
  the criteria pinned in the system prompt, weighing any challenge evidence, then pick one winner and state what
  it sacrifices.
settings:
  agent-config.set_yaml:
    surface: annotation
    session: oneshot
    backend: pydantic-ai
    system_prompt: ''
    mcp: 'off'
    approvals: auto
    selected_file_first: false
folders:
- _skills
accounts: {}
permissions:
  docker: none
  internet: full
  commands: deny
packages: {}
